  "question": {
    "text": "A <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>μF</mi></math> capacitor is charged to a potential difference of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and is connected to another uncharged capacitor in parallel. Now the common potential difference becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>. What is the capacitance value (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math>) of the second capacitor?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>?</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />As,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>500</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math>",
